      "lines": [
        "[Em]Peace! Peace! [G]wonderful peace,",
        "[G/B]Coming [F#m/C#]down [D]from [G]the [Bm]Father [G]above;",
        "[Em]Sweep over [C/G]my spirit [G]forever, I [Am/C]pray,",
        "[G]In fathomless billows of love."
